                <p class="scientific">
                    Magnolia
                </p>

                <p class="detail-intro">
                    Magnolia is an elegant flowering plant known for its
                    large, beautiful blooms and pleasant fragrance.
                    Magnolias can become impressive garden plants and
                    are admired for their timeless appearance.
                </p>


                <!-- QUICK INFO -->
                <div class="quick-info">

